    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνθρονος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enthroned with</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνθρονος Ἡφαίστῳ</span> Orac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Peregr.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				383.60
			</span></i> (Nemrud Dagh, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.92
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τέρμασιν εὐμαθίας</span>”
