					<u>AP</u>
					12.257.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>): c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῶν ἐν Αἰγύπτῳ θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.961
				</span></i>
