				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.467.6
			</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>): abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. Δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.445
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i> Aeg.).</div>
